# Icon Component

The `Icon` component is used to render icons in your application. It's part of the `@sc-ui/beteast/icons` package.

## Usage

Below is an example of how to use the `Icon` component:

```jsx
import React from 'react';
import { Icon } from '@sc-ui/beteast/icons';

const MyComponent = () => (
    <div>
        <Icon name="arrow-down" />
    </div>
);

export default MyComponent;
```
